    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλί̆καρπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rich in fine fruit</i>, of
			places, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σικελία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					371
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				464
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.3.21
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.8.1
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος, τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.19.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of trees,
				<i>bearing fine fruit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῖλαξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					108
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.17.10
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόνυσος κ</span>., identified with
			Domitian, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jahresh.</u>
				18
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Beibl.</u>
				55
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Anazarba</span>).</div>
